notch-lab includes work from these projects.

herdr-go (MIT) — https://github.com/MaxBoiko21/herdr-go
  tools/icon/letters.swift and tools/verify/{bg,keys,mouse}.swift are copied from it.
  internal/filetree, filesearch, filepreview, diffview and platform/* are copied from it,
  with notch-lab hooks added to filetree (Mark, Menu, Open, HideDots).

mygo (MIT) — https://github.com/egoist/mygo
  The app builds on a fork, github.com/sviniabanditka/mygo, branch notch-lab.

Search by Office Commun (MIT) — the Shim JavaScript and the design of the
  Extension layer (from milestone M4).

Go dependencies: see go.mod; their licenses are those of each module.

Lucide (ISC) — https://lucide.dev
  The icons in internal/shell/icons.go are Lucide shapes.

Ghostty (MIT) — https://ghostty.org
  libghostty-vt, through mygo's plugins/terminal, emulates every terminal Tab
  and the Daemon's headless terminals; the bundle carries libghostty-vt.dylib.

creack/pty (MIT) — the Daemon's pseudo-terminals.

chroma (MIT), go-gitdiff (MIT), goldmark (MIT) — highlighting, diffs, markdown.
